{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"卷积"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"卷积"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>群上</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 上的函数或层通过乘法映射 $m\\colon G\\times G\\to G$ 作卷积:\n$$\r\nf * g := m_! (f \\boxtimes g).\r\n$$\n其中 $m_!$ 的直观为沿纤维求和 ("},{"Local":{"url":"依值和","text":"依值和"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n"}]}}